export anchor Pricing:
    description:
        The public pricing page.

    toggle:
        Monthly or Yearly billing, with Yearly selected and the note "2 months free".

    plans:
        free:
            name: Free
            price: 0 per month
            for: Up to 5 people, 3 projects, 1 GB files, community help
            button: Start free
        team:
            name: Team
            price: 8 per person per month, billed yearly
            for: Unlimited projects, reports, guest access, 100 GB files, email help
            button: Start 14-day trial
            badge: Most popular
        business:
            name: Business
            price: 15 per person per month, billed yearly
            for: Everything in Team, single sign-on, audit log, admin roles, priority help
            button: Talk to sales

    comparison:
        A table that compares the three plans on people, projects, file storage,
        reports, guests, single sign-on and audit log, using ticks, dashes and
        numbers.

    faq:
        - Can I change plans later? Yes, any time, and we prorate the difference.
        - Do you offer discounts for nonprofits? Yes, 50 percent off Team.
        - What happens when a trial ends? You move to Free unless you add a card.
